{"id":"107-09","year":107,"num":9,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/107/107_Q09.png","answer":"C","codes":["S-9-5","S-8-8"],"perf":["s-IV-14","s-IV-2"],"book":"B5","chapter":"第2章 圓","topic":"扇形面積（等腰導角）","difficulty":"難",
 "solution":"BC=4 → 半徑 BD=DC=2。∠C=180−60−100=20°。DE=DC → △DCE 等腰 → ∠DEC=20° → ∠EDC=140° → ∠BDE=40°。扇形面積=π×2²×(40/360)=4π/9。選 (C)。",
