{"id":"107-13","year":107,"num":13,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/107/107_Q13.png","answer":"C","codes":["A-7-8"],"perf":["a-IV-3"],"book":"B2","chapter":"第4章 一元一次不等式","topic":"利潤不等式","difficulty":"中",
 "solution":"成本=1000+5n、收入=15n。利潤>成本的2成：15n−(1000+5n)>0.2(1000+5n) → 10n−1000>200+n → 9n>1200 → n>133.3 → 至少 134 張。選 (C)。",
 "steps":["成本=設計費 1000+每張 5 元","利潤=15n−成本","15n−(1000+5n)>0.2(1000+5n)","9n>1200 → n≥134"]},
{"id":"107-14","year":107,"num":14,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/107/107_Q14.png","answer":"A","codes":["S-9-9"],"perf":["s-IV-11"],"book":"B5","chapter":"第3章 推理與證明（三心）","topic":"內心角度計算","difficulty":"難",
 "solution":"∠A=80° → ∠AIB=90°+∠C/2=118°。ID⊥BC 且 ∠IBD=22° → ∠BID=68°。∠AID=∠AIB+∠BID=186°，取劣角 360°−186°=174°。選 (A)。",
