{"id":"107-20","year":107,"num":20,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/107/107_Q20.png","answer":"B","codes":["S-9-4","S-8-4"],"perf":["s-IV-12","s-IV-4"],"book":"B5","chapter":"第1章 相似形","topic":"摺紙與 30-60-90","difficulty":"難",
 "solution":"△ABE 直角於 A：∠AEB=60° → AE=AB/√3=6√3/√3=6? 準確：tan60=AB/AE → AE=6√3/√3=6。摺疊後 ∠BEA′=60° → ∠A′ED=180−120=60°，EA′=6。A′ 到 AD 的投影：EG=6×cos60°=3 → A 到 A′ 的水平總距離=AE+EG=9 → A′F=AD−9=13−9=4。選 (B)。",
 "steps":["△ABE：∠AEB=60°、AB=6√3 → AE=6","摺疊：∠AEA′=120° → ∠A′ED=60°、EA′=6","A′ 在水平方向距 E 為 6cos60°=3","A′F=13−(6+3)=4"],
 "trap":"AF 其實是 A′ 到 CD 的水平距離，用「13 減掉累計水平長」最快。"},
{"id":"107-21","year":107,"num":21,"type":"choice","img":"01_題目圖片/107/107_Q21.png","answer":"A","codes":["F-9-2"],"perf":["f-IV-2","f-IV-3"],"book":"B6","chapter":"第1章 二次函數","topic":"拋物線與水平線交點","difficulty":"難",
